and professional worlds.',NULL,'NO',35),(268,59,2,'The overall value of automated translation to family life is yet to be shown.',NULL,'YES',36),(269,59,2,'Automated translation could make life more difficult for immigrant families.',NULL,'NO',37),(270,59,2,'Visual aspects of language translation are being considered by scientists.',NULL,'NOT GIVEN',38),(271,59,2,'International scientists have found English easier to translate into other languages than Latin.',NULL,'NOT GIVEN',39),(272,59,2,'As far as language is concerned, there is a difference between people’s social and practical needs.',NULL,'YES',40);
